[[{"id":30459584074,"node_id":"LE_lADOAgUK288AAAABPcqdrc8AAAAHF4heSg","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/apache/airflow/issues/events/30459584074","actor":{"login":"stephen-bracken","id":18257727,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE4MjU3NzI3","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/18257727?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/stephen-bracken","html_url":"https://github.com/stephen-bracken","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stephen-bracken/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stephen-bracken/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stephen-bracken/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stephen-bracken/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stephen-bracken/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stephen-bracken/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stephen-bracken/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stephen-bracken/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stephen-bracken/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"event":"labeled","commit_id":null,"commit_url":null,"created_at":"2026-09-03T02:58:22Z","label":{"name":"kind:feature","color":"5319e7"},"intent":null,"performed_via_github_app":null},{"id":30459584218,"node_id":"LE_lADOAgUK288AAAABPcqdrc8AAAAHF4he2g","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/apache/airflow/issues/events/30459584218","actor":{"login":"stephen-bracken","id":18257727,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE4MjU3NzI3","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/18257727?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/stephen-bracken","html_url":"https://github.com/stephen-bracken","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stephen-bracken/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stephen-bracken/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stephen-bracken/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stephen-bracken/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stephen-bracken/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stephen-bracken/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stephen-bracken/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stephen-bracken/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stephen-bracken/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"event":"labeled","commit_id":null,"commit_url":null,"created_at":"2026-09-03T02:58:22Z","label":{"name":"needs-triage","color":"b60205"},"intent":null,"performed_via_github_app":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/apache/airflow/issues/comments/5519790928","html_url":"https://github.com/apache/airflow/issues/72465#issuecomment-5519790928","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/apache/airflow/issues/72465","id":5519790928,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAgUK288AAAABSQFTUA","user":{"login":"Kunal8954","id":230831166,"node_id":"U_kgDODcI0Pg","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/230831166?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kunal8954","html_url":"https://github.com/Kunal8954","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kunal8954/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kunal8954/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kunal8954/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kunal8954/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kunal8954/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kunal8954/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kunal8954/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kunal8954/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kunal8954/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-09-03T03:15:40Z","updated_at":"2026-09-03T03:15:40Z","body":"I'd like to take a shot at this. Here's a concrete design, mirroring the existing operators-and-hooks-ref/CLI-ref generators (devel-common/src/sphinx_exts/operators_and_hooks_ref.py) so it fits how this repo already auto-generates reference docs, rather than adding a new bespoke mechanism.\n\nWhat to introspect\n\nThe full RBAC surface is already centralized on BaseAuthManager (airflow-core/src/airflow/api_fastapi/auth/managers/base_auth_manager.py):\n\nEach is_authorized_* method (configuration, connection, dag, asset, asset_alias, pool, team, variable, view, custom_view) is one resource.\nIts method: ResourceMethod (GET/POST/PUT/DELETE, plus MENU for is_authorized_view) is the action.\nDagAccessEntity and AccessView (.../auth/managers/models/resource_details.py) further scope is_authorized_dag / is_authorized_view into sub-resources (task logs, XCom, audit log, cluster activity, docs, plugins, …).\nThe *Details dataclasses (ConnectionDetails, DagDetails, PoolDetails, TeamDetails, VariableDetails, …) describe what further narrows a check, e.g. team_name.\n\nSince every auth manager only overrides these same method signatures, a new Sphinx extension can walk BaseAuthManager with inspect (methods, their docstrings, type hints) plus the two enums, and render one reference table — resource → allowed methods → sub-entities → docstring — the same way operators_and_hooks_ref.py walks provider YAMLs into a jinja2-rendered RST table.\n\nWhere it'd live\n\nA new page under airflow-core/docs/core-concepts/auth-manager/ (e.g. rbac-ref.rst), registered as a custom directive in airflow-core/docs/conf.py alongside the other custom directives. That way it rebuilds automatically whenever is_authorized_* signatures or docstrings change — no hand-maintained spec to drift out of sync, which is exactly the maintenance burden this issue describes.\n\nHappy to send a first draft PR along these lines — unless the intent is closer to a machine-readable spec (JSON/OpenAPI-shaped) that KeycloakAuthManager and similar providers could import programmatically, rather than only a human-readable RST page. Let me know if that's the direction and I'll adjust before implementing.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/apache/airflow/issues/comments/5519790928/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null,"event":"commented","actor":{"login":"Kunal8954","id":230831166,"node_id":"U_kgDODcI0Pg","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/230831166?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kunal8954","html_url":"https://github.com/Kunal8954","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kunal8954/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kunal8954/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kunal8954/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kunal8954/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kunal8954/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kunal8954/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kunal8954/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kunal8954/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kunal8954/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false}},{"actor":{"login":"anmolxlight","id":116251176,"node_id":"U_kgDOBu3aKA","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/116251176?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/anmolxlight","html_url":"https://github.com/anmolxlight","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anmolxlight/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anmolxlight/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anmolxlight/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anmo